From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:47:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/39] Don't drop audio streams without tags

Audio streams without any tags were never mapped, so the video
played without sound.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 streamhandler.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/streamhandler.cpp b/streamhandler.cpp
index ffd7a89..5d1a81f 100644
--- a/streamhandler.cpp
+++ b/streamhandler.cpp
@@ -601,6 +601,9 @@ std::shared_ptr<std::string> StreamHandler::probeFfmpeg(const std::string& url)
                         } else {
                             bestProgram.push_back(el);
                         }
+                    } else {
+                        // audio without any tags
+                        bestProgram.push_back(el);
                     }
                 }
             }
